{"text": "Boreal Ledger Chartered Professional Accountants\nCORRESPONDENCE SUMMARY -- for file and for the partner\n\nClient:   Gagnon-Tremblay Forestry Services Inc. (\"GTFS\")\n          BN 74418 2093 RT0001\n          1184 chemin Kamiskotia Road, Timmins ON  P4N 7C3\nOwner:    Jean-Luc Gagnon-Tremblay (SIN 517-596-169), cell 705-555-0183\nOur file: BL-2210-GST          Summary by: M. MacGillivray, 2026-10-09\n\nWHAT CAME IN\n1. CRA letter dated September 3, 2026, received here Sept. 11. GST/HST audit, reporting periods\n   2024-01-01 to 2025-12-31. Auditor: S. Bhattacharya, Audit Division,\n   Sudbury Tax Services Office. Tel 705-555-0127, ext. 4418. Fax 705-555-0101.\n   Case ref. GH-2026-118-4471.\n2. Proposal letter dated October 1, 2026: proposed adjustments of $41,280.16 plus\n   interest. French copy shows it as 41 280,16 $. Thirty days to respond.\n\nWHAT THEY ARE PROPOSING\n(a) Deny ITCs of $27,930.00 on invoices from Abitibi Trail Equipment Rentals Ltd. -- auditor says\n    supplier's registration number on the invoices is invalid (ETA s. 169(4) documentary\n    requirements). Abitibi Trail is real and we rented from them all of 2024; their BN was\n    printed with two digits transposed. Fixable with corrected invoices.\n(b) Assess GST/HST of $9,412.50 on the sale of the old skidder to Jean-Luc's sister-in-law,\n    Sylvie Gagnon-Tremblay, for CAD 72,500 in March 2025. No tax was charged. She is not\n    a registrant. He treated it as a \"family thing.\" Assessment is probably right.\n(c) Deny $3,937.66 ITCs on meals/fuel -- no receipts. Partly right.\n\nWHAT I DID\n- Called Ms. Bhattacharya Oct 6. Reasonable. She will accept corrected supplier invoices on\n  (a) if received by October 30, 2026. Extension to Nov 13 available on written request.\n- Confirmed our authorization (Form RC59) is on file; rep ID RM7K2Q4.\n- Emailed Jean-Luc at jlgt@gtforestry.example asking for the Abitibi Trail contact and the\n  skidder bill of sale. No answer yet. His wife says he is in camp until the 20th with no signal.\n\nEXPOSURE\nBest case about $11,000 incl. interest; worst case the full proposal, roughly $46k\nwith interest. The operating account at Caisse populaire de Timmins (transit 00417, acct\n0884-217) had $18,204.11 at month end, so worst case needs a payment arrangement.\n\nNOTE FOR PARTNER\nMr. Gagnon-Tremblay also asked whether the audit \"has anything to do with\"\nhis 2019 consumer proposal. I said no, but T2 arrears from that period still show.", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "369 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Jean-Luc Gagnon-Tremblay", "Sylvie Gagnon-Tremblay", "Ms. Bhattacharya", "Gagnon-Tremblay"], "companies": ["Boreal Ledger", "CRA", "Abitibi Trail Equipment Rentals Ltd.", "GTFS", "Caisse populaire de Timmins", "example"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.2000000011175871, "modelMs": 25465.199999999255, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "passport_dl", "routing", "phone", "record", "vin", "account", "money", "dob", "age90", "date", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "names"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 13, "text": "Boreal Ledger", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Boreal Ledger"}, {"start": 115, "end": 130, "text": "Gagnon-Tremblay", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Gagnon-Tremblay"}, {"start": 156, "end": 160, "text": "GTFS", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "GTFS"}, {"start": 176, "end": 193, "text": "74418 2093 RT0001", "kind": "bn_ca", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "74418 2093 RT0001"}, {"start": 245, "end": 252, "text": "P4N 7C3", "kind": "postal_ca", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "P4N 7C3"}, {"start": 263, "end": 287, "text": "Jean-Luc Gagnon-Tremblay", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Jean-Luc Gagnon-Tremblay"}, {"start": 293, "end": 304, "text": "517-596-169", "kind": "sin_ca", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "517-596-169"}, 